<title>SPAIN: Spain's Vitoria Oct air cargo volume growth continues.</title>
<headline>Spain's Vitoria Oct air cargo volume growth continues.</headline>
<dateline>VITORIA, Spain 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cargo traffic at Vitoria airport in northern Spain rose by just over 60 percent in October to 2,985 tonnes from 1,851 tonnes in the same month last year, the airport authority said.</p>
<p>This compares with 2,184 tonnes in September which was an increase of 97 percent on September 1995 and takes the accumulated total this year to 19,765 tonnes against 9,109 tonnes in the first 10 months of last year.</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
